{"seq":1,"slug":"ddl-and-dml","title":"DDL 与 DML","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/ddl-and-dml","wordCount":542,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ddl-与-dml\">DDL 与 DML</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQL 语言按功能分为数据定义语言（DDL）和数据操作语言（DML）两大类。DDL 负责定义和管理数据库结构，DML 负责对数据进行增删改查操作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>核心语句</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DDL</td>\n<td>Data Definition Language</td>\n<td>CREATE、ALTER、DROP、TRUNCATE</td>\n<td>管理表结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DML</td>\n<td>Data Manipulation Language</td>\n<td>INSERT、UPDATE、DELETE、SELECT</td>\n<td>操作表数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCL</td>\n<td>Data Control Language</td>\n<td>GRANT、REVOKE</td>\n<td>权限控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCL</td>\n<td>Transaction Control Language</td>\n<td>COMMIT、ROLLBACK、SAVEPOINT</td>\n<td>事务控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据类型\">数据类型</h2><p>选择合适的数据类型是表结构设计的第一步。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>MySQL 类型</th>\n<th>PostgreSQL 类型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>TINYINT、INT、BIGINT</td>\n<td>SMALLINT、INTEGER、BIGINT</td>\n<td>计数、ID、状态码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点</td>\n<td>FLOAT、DOUBLE</td>\n<td>REAL、DOUBLE PRECISION</td>\n<td>科学计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确数值</td>\n<td>DECIMAL(M,D)</td>\n<td>NUMERIC(M,D)</td>\n<td>金额、货币</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td>VARCHAR(N)、TEXT</td>\n<td>VARCHAR(N)、TEXT</td>\n<td>名称、描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期时间</td>\n<td>DATE、DATETIME、TIMESTAMP</td>\n<td>DATE、TIMESTAMP、TIMESTAMPTZ</td>\n<td>时间记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>TINYINT(1) / BOOLEAN</td>\n<td>BOOLEAN</td>\n<td>开关标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON、JSONB</td>\n<td>半结构化数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制</td>\n<td>BLOB、BINARY</td>\n<td>BYTEA</td>\n<td>文件、加密数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ddl-数据定义\">DDL：数据定义</h2><h3 id=\"create-创建表\">CREATE — 创建表</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE users (&#10;    user_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    username    VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;    email       VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,&#10;    password_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,&#10;    status      VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT &#39;active&#39; CHECK (status IN (&#39;active&#39;, &#39;inactive&#39;, &#39;banned&#39;)),&#10;    created_at  TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    updated_at  TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    order_id    BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    user_id     BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES users(user_id),&#10;    total       DECIMAL(12, 2) NOT NULL CHECK (total &gt;= 0),&#10;    status      VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;,&#10;    created_at  TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_user_id ON orders(user_id);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_created_at ON orders(created_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    username    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    password_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">255</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inactive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'banned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    updated_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(user_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(user_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(created_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"alter-修改表\">ALTER — 修改表</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN phone VARCHAR(20);&#10;&#10;ALTER TABLE users ALTER COLUMN email SET NOT NULL;&#10;&#10;ALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN phone;&#10;&#10;ALTER TABLE users RENAME COLUMN username TO name;&#10;&#10;ALTER TABLE orders ADD CONSTRAINT fk_user&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES users(user_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN phone </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DROP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN phone;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users RENAME COLUMN username </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fk_user</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(user_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"drop-与-truncate\">DROP 与 TRUNCATE</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"DROP TABLE IF EXISTS temp_logs;&#10;&#10;DROP TABLE orders CASCADE;&#10;&#10;TRUNCATE TABLE logs;&#10;&#10;TRUNCATE TABLE logs RESTART IDENTITY CASCADE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DROP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp_logs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DROP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders CASCADE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TRUNCATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TRUNCATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RESTART</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CASCADE;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>可回滚</th>\n<th>重置自增</th>\n<th>触发触发器</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DELETE</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRUNCATE</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DROP</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dml-数据操作\">DML：数据操作</h2><h3 id=\"insert-插入数据\">INSERT — 插入数据</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO users (username, email, password_hash)&#10;VALUES (&#39;alice&#39;, &#39;alice@example.com&#39;, &#39;hash_abc123&#39;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO users (username, email, password_hash) VALUES&#10;    (&#39;bob&#39;, &#39;bob@example.com&#39;, &#39;hash_def456&#39;),&#10;    (&#39;carol&#39;, &#39;carol@example.com&#39;, &#39;hash_ghi789&#39;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO order_archive (order_id, user_id, total, created_at)&#10;SELECT order_id, user_id, total, created_at&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE created_at &lt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users (username, email, password_hash)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hash_abc123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users (username, email, password_hash) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bob@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hash_def456'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'carol'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'carol@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hash_ghi789'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_archive (order_id, user_id, total, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, user_id, total, created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"update-更新数据\">UPDATE — 更新数据</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE users SET status = &#39;inactive&#39;&#10;WHERE last_login &lt; CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;180 days&#39;;&#10;&#10;UPDATE orders o SET status = &#39;cancelled&#39;&#10;FROM users u&#10;WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id AND u.status = &#39;banned&#39;;&#10;&#10;UPDATE products SET&#10;    price = price * 0.9,&#10;    updated_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;WHERE category = &#39;electronics&#39; AND stock &gt; 100;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'inactive'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_login </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'180 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cancelled'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'banned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electronics'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"delete-删除数据\">DELETE — 删除数据</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"DELETE FROM logs WHERE created_at &lt; CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;;&#10;&#10;DELETE FROM order_items&#10;WHERE order_id IN (&#10;    SELECT order_id FROM orders WHERE status = &#39;cancelled&#39;&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cancelled'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"表结构设计原则\">表结构设计原则</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主键选择</td>\n<td>优先使用代理键（自增 ID）</td>\n<td>BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命名规范</td>\n<td>蛇形命名，表名复数或单数统一</td>\n<td>user_profiles、order_items</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适当冗余</td>\n<td>高频查询字段可适当冗余</td>\n<td>订单表冗余 user_name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOT NULL 优先</td>\n<td>除非业务允许空值，否则设为 NOT NULL</td>\n<td>email VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认值</td>\n<td>为状态字段提供合理默认值</td>\n<td>DEFAULT &#39;active&#39;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳</td>\n<td>每张表添加 created_at/updated_at</td>\n<td>TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((DDL 与 DML))&#10;    DDL 定义结构&#10;      CREATE 创建&#10;      ALTER 修改&#10;      DROP 删除&#10;      TRUNCATE 清空&#10;    DML 操作数据&#10;      INSERT 插入&#10;      UPDATE 更新&#10;      DELETE 删除&#10;    数据类型&#10;      数值型&#10;      字符型&#10;      日期时间&#10;      JSON&#10;    设计原则&#10;      代理键&#10;      NOT NULL 优先&#10;      时间戳\">mindmap\n  root((DDL 与 DML))\n    DDL 定义结构\n      CREATE 创建\n      ALTER 修改\n      DROP 删除\n      TRUNCATE 清空\n    DML 操作数据\n      INSERT 插入\n      UPDATE 更新\n      DELETE 删除\n    数据类型\n      数值型\n      字符型\n      日期时间\n      JSON\n    设计原则\n      代理键\n      NOT NULL 优先\n      时间戳</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>DDL</strong> 管理表的结构定义，CREATE、ALTER、DROP 是最核心的三个语句。</li>\n<li><strong>DML</strong> 操作表中的数据，INSERT、UPDATE、DELETE 分别对应增、改、删。</li>\n<li>选择合适的<strong>数据类型</strong>（特别是 DECIMAL 用于金额）是表设计的基础。</li>\n<li>TRUNCATE 比 DELETE 更快但不可回滚，适合清空大表。</li>\n<li>表设计应遵循<strong>NOT NULL 优先、代理键、时间戳</strong>等基本原则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DDL 与 DML","id":"ddl-与-dml"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据类型","id":"数据类型"},{"level":2,"text":"DDL：数据定义","id":"ddl-数据定义"},{"level":3,"text":"CREATE — 创建表","id":"create-创建表"},{"level":3,"text":"ALTER — 修改表","id":"alter-修改表"},{"level":3,"text":"DROP 与 TRUNCATE","id":"drop-与-truncate"},{"level":2,"text":"DML：数据操作","id":"dml-数据操作"},{"level":3,"text":"INSERT — 插入数据","id":"insert-插入数据"},{"level":3,"text":"UPDATE — 更新数据","id":"update-更新数据"},{"level":3,"text":"DELETE — 删除数据","id":"delete-删除数据"},{"level":2,"text":"表结构设计原则","id":"表结构设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/data-integrity"},"next":{"title":"复杂查询与子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/complex-queries"}}